<title>THAILAND: Thai money market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai money market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's money and foreign exchange markets were closed on Tuesday for the Constitution Day holiday.</p>
<p>On Monday, the interbank overnight rate was quoted at 10.00-10.25 percent while the baht was at 25.566-25.569 to the dollar.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
